WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.522
Wow! Time sure does fly!

2
00:00:04.523 --> 00:00:09.817
This is our last day in the U.S.A.

3
00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:12.815
Sunny: I wish you could stay longer, Young-hee.

4
00:00:12.816 --> 00:00:16.978
Mom: Me too, but my husband and Hada need

5
00:00:16.979 --> 00:00:19.419
me. Bada: Can I stay here,

6
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:24.687
Mom? Sunny: Yes, you can live with

7
00:00:24.688 --> 00:00:28.358
us! Hana: My suitcase won’t close,

8
00:00:28.359 --> 00:00:31.802
Mom! Mom: I think you have too many things,

9
00:00:31.803 --> 00:00:34.049
Hana. Hana: That’s from the

10
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:37.131
zoo. That’s from Tom!

11
00:00:37.132 --> 00:00:40.334
Tom: Did you enjoy your trip to the U.S.A.?

12
00:00:40.335 --> 00:00:43.395
Hana: We had a great

13
00:00:43.396 --> 00:00:45.554
time! Tom: How about you,

14
00:00:45.555 --> 00:00:53.757
Bada? Bada: I’m going to live with Aunt Sunny and Uncle

15
00:00:53.758 --> 00:00:56.078
Tom. Tom: It was so nice to meet

16
00:00:56.079 --> 00:00:58.775
you. Come back and visit soon.

17
00:00:58.776 --> 00:01:02.093
Hana: I hope you can come to visit Korea.

18
00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:05.579
Tom: I hope so.

19
00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:08.777
Time flies by so quickly. Mom:

20
00:01:08.778 --> 00:01:11.975
It feels like we just came yesterday.

21
00:01:11.976 --> 00:01:15.124
Bada: Why do we have to go so soon?

22
00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:19.030
Mom: Don’t you miss Daddy and Hada?

23
00:01:19.031 --> 00:01:21.463
Sunny: I’m going to miss you!

24
00:01:21.464 --> 00:01:23.694
Mom: Come and visit us in Korea.

25
00:01:23.695 --> 00:01:25.560
Tom: We will.

26
00:01:25.561 --> 00:01:30.789
Sunny: Oh, Young-hee, thank you for everything.

27
00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.825
Hana: Good-bye, Aunt Sunny.

28
00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:35.152
Good-bye, Uncle Tom! Bada:

29
00:01:35.153 --> 00:01:36.645
Good-bye! Sunny

30
00:01:36.646 --> 00:01:41.324
& Tom: Good-bye! Take care!

31
00:01:41.325 --> 00:01:46.225
It was hard to say good-bye to Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom.

32
00:01:46.226 --> 00:01:52.041
But we were looking forward to seeing Daddy and Hada.

